         <div type="bio">
            <p>American literary agent in Paris for Boni and Liveright. Fleischman met Joyce in Paris in late 1921; they corresponded sporadically for several years as Fleischman tried to interest Joyce in publishing <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Ulysses</name> in the United States, but to no avail. He was married to <name type="person" key="joyc94">Helen Kastor</name> (who later married <name type="person" key="joyc05">Giorgio Joyce</name>) from 1915 to 1928 and was the father of <name type="person" key="flei19">David Fleischman</name>. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
         </div>
      </body>
